`cJSON_CreateNumber` creates a new `cJSON` number item from a `double`. Use it to build JSON numeric values. On success it sets type to `cJSON_Number`, stores `valuedouble`, and saturates `valueint` to `INT_MAX/INT_MIN` on overflow; returns `NULL` if allocation fails.
