5. `cJSON_CreateStringArray`
​ Creates a cJSON array from `count` C strings. Use with a non-NULL `strings` pointer and `count >= 0`. Returns NULL on invalid input, array creation failure, or any string item allocation failure; on failure it deletes the partial array.
