/* Render a cJSON entity to text for transfer/storage. */
CJSON_PUBLIC(char *)
cJSON_Print(const cJSON *item);
​ ```
4. `cJSON_Version`
​ `cJSON_Version()` returns a static, null-terminated string with the library version (`major.minor.patch`). Call it with no args to read the cJSON version. It formats the value each call and returns the same internal buffer.
​ Its signature is:
